      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per hour</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature of your level or lower within 60 feet of you dies or gains the dying condition.</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You pull the vibrant dissipating remains of a dying creature’s ether. You draw it into a @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.feats.Item.cN0RefdXwBD9KgoF]{Effect: Mote of Ether}. You can then choose to absorb it as hit points, recovering hit points equal to its level, or you can absorb it as a focus point, granting you one focus point.</p>"
